<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39552" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulvĕrĕus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		pulvis. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>containing dust</i>, <i>filled with</i> or <i>full of
			dust</i>, <i>dust-</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nubes,</span>”
				<i>clouds of dust</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 593</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turbo,</span>”
				<i>a whirlwind of dust</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. B. Get. 458</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">farina,</span>”
				<i>fine as dust</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Med.
					Fac. 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					7, 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aequor,</span>”
				<i>a battle-field filled with dust</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 11, 403</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 493</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspectus,</span>”
				<i>dusty</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 10, 61, § 170</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">erat ex itinere anhelus et pulvereus,</span>”
				<i>covered with dust</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pac. Pan. Theod. 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulverei et cinerosi mortui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p. 150, 27</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>that raises the
			dust</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">equi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 4, 608</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palla,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					6, 705</span></i>
			.</div>
